flowchart LR
    U[Owner: pets + tasks] --> S[Scheduler]
    K[(knowledge/ docs)] --> I[Indexer: chunk + TF-IDF]
    I --> R[Retriever: top-k + score]
    S -->|pet profile + task query| R
    R --> G{Score above threshold?}
    G -- no --> F[Fallback: ask your vet]
    G -- yes --> P[Plan builder: adjusts tasks, cites sources]
    P --> H[Human review: accept or edit]
    H --> O[Saved daily plan + explanation]
    P --> L[(Logs)]
    T[Test harness: preset pets] -.checks.-> P
